annel, history, and moral responsibility."}]}, {"id": "b7245e13-8ec3-47cc-a1d2-115cb7d5828e", "type": "topic", "title": "Self, Identity, Perception, and Impression Formation", "description": "Explains how self-concept and perception shape how people interpret one another.", "children": [{"id": "6457ac15-1089-4e3d-b2db-ec5b7a365b1c", "type": "subtopic", "title": "Self-Concept and Identity", "children": [{"id": "f0077ab0-f71f-461a-8042-5dcc1bdd4c86", "type": "concept", "title": "self-concept"}, {"id": "68b14492-b0f6-4e03-9358-5ee3d6cccf14", "type": "concept", "title": "self-esteem"}, {"id": "021fdfee-d96c-4124-ba5e-751b98872692", "type": "concept", "title": "identity"}, {"id": "86733f10-4bd6-47cb-b8ba-592fdf12d24a", "type": "concept", "title": "social identity"}, {"id": "8e626ff3-a841-454c-8f7f-b31c05bbdbc4", "type": "concept", "title": "role identity"}, {"id": "5fdfcef9-c2ad-4fcb-bdad-7696d2877194", "type": "concept", "title": "identity salience"}, {"id": "c0803c9f-edaf-4f33-87c0-56b35d4903db", "type": "concept", "title": "self-fulfilling prophecy"}, {"id": "263e794d-c19e-4313-b56e-4a0ab70faa59", "type": "concept", "title": "identity negotiation"}, {"id": "74e5e46e-f706-4ca0-801c-01e49fdca0d9", "type": "concept", "title": "face"}], "description": "Students examine how people understand themselves and perform identities in interaction."}, {"id": "a1bfbc0f-c90b-4ccc-97fb-a186a114c115", "type": "subtopic", "title": "Perception and Attribution", "children": [{"id": "6b930dc0-47db-4b87-97d0-f1889834c35a", "type": "concept", "title": "selection"}, {"id": "e60ee9fd-f276-45fc-b5d1-d04328062b78", "type": "concept", "title": "organization"}, {"id": "56a84fd0-48a2-4b21-af25-98ff2fd478f8", "type": "concept", "title": "interpretation"}, {"id": "efe7bb1f-a4c7-44d2-bf8f-03ecdccb8019", "type": "concept", "title": "attribution"}, {"id": "17d465d3-3407-42ad-b289-663dab87ffd3", "type": "concept", "title": "fundamental attribution error"}, {"id": "0003fa1f-d185-4f7d-8b38-17d30bd242f9", 